id: ohf_runtime
label: OHF Rust Runtime
package: custom
description: >
  The single static library aggregating all Rust-backed components (crates/ohf-firmware),
  built by tools/build_project.py and dropped here before link. It carries the one Rust
  #[panic_handler]; component crates are rlibs linked into it. Rust-backed components
  `require` this instead of declaring their own `library:`.
category: Platform|Rust
quality: production
library:
  - path: lib/libohf_firmware.a
provides:
  - name: ohf_runtime
